{"id": "17-3183-2-11", "zh": "lū 表示“切割”，在 nā 前变为短音，得 lunāti、lunanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3183-12-16", "zh": "lūyati、lūyanti，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3184-2-8", "zh": "dhū 表示“摇动”，得 dhunāti、dhunanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3184-9-13", "zh": "dhūyati、dhūyanti，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3185-2-8", "zh": "gaha 表示“执取”，在遇到 nā 的时候——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3186-2-6", "zh": "517. 在 gaha 等词根之后，加 ppa、ṇhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3187-2-11", "zh": "在 gaha 等词根之后，表示主动语态时，加 ppa、ṇhā 这两个词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3187-12-15", "zh": "这里的 ādi（等）一词表示“同类”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3188-2-9", "zh": "“gahassa”（gaha 的）一词从上条延续适用。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3189-2-7", "zh": "518. 在 ṇhā 前，ha 音脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3190-2-13", "zh": "当后面接词缀 ṇhā 时，词根 gaha 的 ha 音脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3190-14-22", "zh": "sīlaṃ gaṇhāti（他受持戒）；变为短音时，也作 gaṇhati；gaṇhanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3190-23-26", "zh": "gaṇhāsi、gaṇhātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3190-27-30", "zh": "gaṇhāmi、gaṇhāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3191-2-24", "zh": "在被动语态中，承接“ye”一条，依“havipariyayo lo vā”一条，ha 音与 ya 音互换位置。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3191-25-28", "zh": "gayhati、gayhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-2-5", "zh": "gaṇhātu、gaṇhantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-6-11", "zh": "gaṇha、gaṇhāhi、gaṇhātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-12-15", "zh": "gaṇhāmi、gaṇhāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-16-19", "zh": "gaṇhataṃ、gaṇhantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-20-23", "zh": "gayhataṃ、gayhantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-24-27", "zh": "gayhatu、gayhantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-28-33", "zh": "gaṇhe、gaṇheyya、gaṇheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-34-37", "zh": "gayheyya、gayheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3192-38-45", "zh": "aggaṇhi、gaṇhi、aggaṇhiṃsu、gaṇhiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3193-2-21", "zh": "当依“kvaci dhātu”等条，在非全时语尾（asabbadhātuka）前中间词缀脱落、增插的 i 音又变为 e 时，就增插 s 音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-3194-2-5", "zh": "aggahesi、aggahesuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-6-11", "zh": "aggahi、aggahiṃsu、aggahuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-12-15", "zh": "aggayhittha、aggayhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-16-19", "zh": "gaṇhissati、gaṇhissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-20-23", "zh": "gahessati、gahessanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-24-27", "zh": "gahīyissate、gahīyissante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-28-31", "zh": "gayhissati、gayhissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-32-35", "zh": "aggaṇhissa、aggahissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-36-39", "zh": "aggaṇhissatha、aggahissatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3194-40-44", "zh": "aggayhissatha、aggayhissa，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3195-2-4", "zh": "在词缀 ppa 前——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3196-2-8", "zh": "519. 在 ppa 前，gaha 变为 ghe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3197-2-12", "zh": "当后面接词缀 ppa 时，词根 gaha 整个替换为 ghe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3197-13-15", "zh": "gheppati，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3198-2-3", "zh": "以上是 kī 等词根类。", "confidence": 75}
